            "Temporary repair, mitigation, lodging, or continuity receipts",
            "Contractor scope, estimate, invoice, or inspection reference",
            "Prior repair, maintenance, or pre-existing condition records",
            "Damaged-item retention, disposal authorization, and location log",
            "Lease, mortgage, tenant, or additional-interest routing record"
